        'ECOM-01':['Catalog and localization teams','Product facts and candidate content changes','Content decisions and rejection reasons','Accept an eligible change for the next review stage or reject a protected-fact change; no product is published.'],
        'ECOM-02':['Customer review operations','Example customer reviews','Complaint classification and response-review routing','Inspect safety complaints before approving a public response.'],
        'ECOM-03':['Inventory operations','Example inventory observations with freshness information','Reconciliation and freshness decisions','Review stale or conflicting evidence before a stock update.'],
        'ECOM-04':['Support operations','Example support requests','Redacted content and SLA routing','Review the destination and redaction before handling the request.'],
        'ACC-01':['Accounts payable teams','Example invoices and banking-change checks','Matching, duplicate and exception output','Investigate a blocked invoice or banking exception before payment approval.'],
